{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年8月11日 15:34 星期二</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>本港今日（11日）天氣仍然極端酷熱，截至下午2時40分，天文台指出部分地區氣溫達36°C甚至37°C。本文綜合部分便利店及超市雪糕消暑優惠。</p></div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-11T08:19:26.639616+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none"}}